  "walkthrough.student.connect.description": "Point Computor at your server and sign in with the same account as on the Computor website. For computor.at, the backend URL is https://computor.at/api. No account yet? Create one on the website and join your course there.\n[Set the backend URL](command:computor.changeRealmUrl)\n[Sign in](command:computor.login)",
